title: 'frame-support: make `#[stored]` work in crates without a direct `derive-where` dependency'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `#[frame_support::stored]` resolves `derive_where` through the `frame_support::derive_where`
    re-export, so it works on generic types in crates that do not depend on `derive-where`
    directly.
crates:
- name: frame-support-procedural
  bump: patch
